WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.180
A Selfish Skit.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.120
Hey, play the idiot.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.190
You first, idiot!

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:13.060
We can't have everyone play the straight man!

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.590
You're being Selfish. {Now would be a great time to laugh at any group that left it as "Jikochuu"}

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.260
You're one to talk!

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.430
Thank you very much.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.070
What a dud.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:25.140
<i>You're</i> the one who asked us to entertain you...

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.310
Maybe I should smack her upside the head.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.010
Don't.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:31.380
She's King Selfish's daughter.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:35.310
That girl was much more entertaining...

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.450
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.750
Cure Heart...

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.920
I'll make you mine!

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:53.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:00.600
Every day it sparkles

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:04.300
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:11.190
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:16.860
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:22.490
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:33.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:42.510
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.180
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:56.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:02.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:08.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:19.990
Regina's Fierce Attack! 

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:19.990
Regina's Fierce Attack! 

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.320
Work keeps you pretty busy, Makopi.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:23.960
Yeah.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.420
The movie received good reviews,

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.590
so now I'm working on...

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:28.830
Hi, Mana!

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.500
Regina?!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.330
Sorry for our little spat last time.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:39.140
If a "sorry" could cut it, we wouldn't need Precures!

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.610
What are you plotting now?

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:44.580
I just can't stop thinking about Mana.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.550
So...

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.380
I'll let you be my friend!

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.450
Friend?

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.020
You'll <i>let</i> her?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.450
Aren't you happy?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.190
Why would she be <i>happy</i>?

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:58.690
Precure Love Link!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.000
I will not forgive you!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.000
You mad or something?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.200
Of course I'm mad!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.400
The Trump Kingdom...

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.470
my homeland was destroyed!

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.470
Do I look like I care?

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:17.710
Besides, I didn't do that, Daddy did.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:18.940
Why you...

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.380
Stop!

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.310
Mana, move.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.920
Look, let's just calm down. Please?

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.250
Before somebody comes...

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:31.220
Makoto, just go back to normal for now.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.390
Mana.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.930
You and I are friends.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.030
Got it?

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:44.940
Sure.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.200
Let's be friends.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.370
Wait, Mana!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:51.780
Why?

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.910
When you say you'll be friends,

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.250
you aren't serious, are you?

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.850
I am.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.560
I think it'd be nice if we were friends.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.090
Makopi?

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.430
I can't believe you...

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.660
She's our enemy!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.470
Didn't you see it?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:16.740
Trump Kingdom was in ruins!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.000
Yeah.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.870
But somehow...

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:22.210
I feel that Regina's different.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:23.980
Different <i>how</i>?

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.810
She's King Selfish's daughter!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.050
That's true, but... uh...

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.780
I can't really hate her...

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:35.090
Makopi!

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.620
Wait!

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.760
I have no idea what's gotten into your head.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.500
M-Makopi...

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.870
Mana, let's just go to school.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.340
Bye, Regina.

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:51.700
Bye!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.420
Now Makopi totally hates me...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.850
Can you blame her?

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:12.860
You should know how she feels.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.800
Of course she'd be mad.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.030
So why befriend her?

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.270
Well...

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.600
Hi!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.440
Regina?

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.740
Something wrong?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.580
Let's go play, Mana!

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.580
I-I can't!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.750
I have class now...

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.080
Aw, just skip those dumb classes.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.880
Hey, I can't just...

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.820
Morning, class.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.260
What?

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:47.360
It's stuck!

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.330
Now you <i>can't</i> have class!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.660
Nooooooo!

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.160
Excuse me, I have to use the bathroom!

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:57.070
You can't come to school!

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.400
But I did it for you.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.740
Playing's <i>way</i> more fun than studying.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.910
So I did that for you!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.480
Aren't you happy?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:07.810
No, no, no, no, no!

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.750
Look, I can't play now!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.820
We'll talk when school is over.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:12.820
Please?

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.220
Fine, if you say so.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.130
Can we stop by the student council room?

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:26.200
There are some papers I'd like to get signed.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.570
Gotcha.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.530
Mana!

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:30.240
School's out!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.170
Let's play!

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:34.240
We're going to the student council room, so wait a bit more.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:35.870
I'm not waiting.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.110
I'll handle it for you!

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.840
Hold on!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.750
What do you mean by "handle?"

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.180
Erasing the school!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.850
All the boring junk'll be gone once it's gone,

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.890
and then you could play with me right now!

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.420
No, no, no!

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.490
Absolutely not!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.590
Why can't I?

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.060
I'm doing it for you.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.600
Oh, is that so?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.900
If you were really her friend, you'd respect her—

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.970
Nobody asked you.

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:07.510
Rikka?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.040
Let's go!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.240
Mana!

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.780
Geez!

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:21.790
Hurry up!

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.360
I'm hurrying, geez!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.160
Are you sure?

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.130
Just go.

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:36.900
Where should we go?

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:40.140
Huh? Weren't we going where you wanted to go?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:43.610
Nah, we can go somewhere you want.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:45.380
O-Okay...

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.280
then I'll show you around town.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.010
Okay!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.720
Ain't it easy? {America.jpg}

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.190
Well, I suppose...

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.130
Whatcha doin'?

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.090
Picking up trash.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:04.130
Oh, there's more.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.660
I'll help you!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:11.840
Ta-dah!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.210
It's all clean!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.780
Mana and Regina are friends?

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:22.480
It seems quite puzzling.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:25.150
Is Mana all right?

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.990
Of course she is!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:28.120
Why are you here?

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.360
Regina said she was thirsty,

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.960
so I said that Alice's homemade black tea was delicious.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:35.990
Now.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.160
Make it.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:42.770
Since you're a friend of Mana's, I'll pour you some delicious tea.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.100
Please wait a moment.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:48.940
Aww, but I wanna drink it now!

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.710
You can't rush flavor.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.080
The black tea leaves need time to steam,

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:57.320
and the cup needs time to warm... {You're apparently supposed to warm the cup before pouring something hot in it, otherwise the temperatures clash and the tea isn't as hot as it should be. Neat.}

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:02.990
Who's the baby?

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.620
Her name's Ai.

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:10.400
So cute! {God damn my ears}

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.830
You can play with her.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.600
Charles, if you'd please.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.070
Okay!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.100
Charurles!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.090
What're you staring at?

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:41.430
Get back to my tea.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.090
Huh?

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.260
Oh, certainly.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.970
Hey, have you talked to Makopi since this morning?

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.070
She seems busy with work...

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.140
I see...

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.640
Don't start getting friendly with my Mana. {Oh damn, you did not just tell Rikka to step off of her wife.}

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.280
<i>Your</i> Mana?

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.150
She doesn't belong to you!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:04.220
And I've known Mana since we were kids, which is longer than—

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.680
I'm Mana's friend here.

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.320
So...

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:10.360
consider yourself fired.

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:11.290
Huh?!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.720
Rikka...

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.290
Let's go, Mana!

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:17.230
Regina, the tea will be ready...

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.260
Don't need it!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.230
Sorry, girls!

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:21.730
What was <i>that</i>?

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.500
It seems her usual tactics won't work here.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.720
Makopi!

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:48.030
If you miss Makopi that much,

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:50.600
shouldn't you stop trying to be friends with Regina?

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.860
I can't do that!

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.330
Why is that?

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:56.530
Regina said we were friends,

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.870
and I don't think she was lying...

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:02.040
And the thought of being her friend gave me goose bumps!

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:04.140
Goose bumps? How so?

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:09.650
You must be clear with Makoto about what you think.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:13.080
Oh, how do I put it?

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:19.460
Either way, the fact is that she sides with the people who destroyed Trump Kingdom.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.390
It's no surprise that Makopi won't forgive her.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:28.700
So, I really can't be friends with an enemy?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.140
I wouldn't say you can't...

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.970
But I believe it would be very difficult.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.640
I wonder what Makopi's doing...

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:42.380
If you're curious, how about we go and see her?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.610
Really?

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:44.650
In that case...

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.020
Here.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.190
Can you give this to Makopi?

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:49.950
Okay.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.060
Hi, Mana!

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.730
Oh, Regina.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.160
Let's go eat something tasty!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:59.100
Rikka, Alice, please—

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.070
Yummy!

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.410
Mana, this is super yummy!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.640
I know!

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.880
This shop has the best ice cream in town!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:18.250
You're my friend for a reason. You're useful!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.590
Well, I'd rather you call me "reliable."

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.560
The other flavors are yummy, too.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.560
Rikka likes chocolate chip,

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.130
Alice likes mint,

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:30.530
and Makopi likes berry flavor.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.360
Why?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:36.030
You're <i>my</i> friend, aren't you?

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:39.140
So why do you think about other people?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:40.570
Well, I...

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.570
Your only friend is me!

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.010
I'm the only one you have to think about!

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.010
You don't need other people.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:50.050
Wait, hold on!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:50.850
That's too self—

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.080
I know!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.250
I'll just erase what you don't need!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.890
Regina!

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.590
Refreshing!

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:00.420
Okay, cut!

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:02.230
Good work!

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.230
Let's take a break!

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:09.730
No calls from Mana.

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:11.970
Did I ask if there were?

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:13.740
Makopi?

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:17.580
Here, a refreshment.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:20.780
It's Mana's homemade omelette rice.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.190
And why isn't the person who made it here?

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.490
Well...

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.960
She's with Regina, isn't she?

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:34.230
I don't get Mana.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.260
We don't really get it either.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:39.560
Mana doesn't get it herself, after all.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:45.070
She just had a hunch that Regina really wanted to be friends.

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:48.540
Mana's hunches have never been something to sneeze at.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:53.080
She tried to scold that crab Selfish when she first met it, after all.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:55.010
Instead of using her head,

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:59.520
she prefers to trust her feelings and follow her heart.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:04.160
But it's King Selfish's daughter we're talking about,

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:07.060
so I don't think it'll end that well.

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:11.760
Are you not worried about her too, Makoto?

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.400
Found ya!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.900
Regina!

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:23.880
I'm the only friend Mana needs!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.180
Refreshments from the sponsor!

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:36.690
I'll turn you into a splendid Selfish!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.470
Selfreshment! {It's actually not a pun in the JP, but it's too good to pass up.}

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.440
You're all in the way, so get lost.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:59.080
A Selfish appeared!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.010
The girls!

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.150
Selfish! {alt. "Oh yeah!"}

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.650
Let's go, girls!

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:08.390
Rachel!

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:12.260
Precure Love Link!

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.060
L-O-V-E!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:14.630
L-O-V-E!

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:15.460
L-O-V-E!

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:16.660
L-O-V-E!

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:38.950
The light of wisdom,

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.320
Cure Diamond!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.460
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:47.830
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.700
The blade of courage,

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.660
Cure Sword!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:59.270
Have a refreshment!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.740
Drink it all! {2lewd}

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:05.180
You're not gonna drink my juice?!

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:08.150
It's not very refreshing if you force it down our throats!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:10.680
It's certainly selfish.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.420
Really, how self-centered!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.520
Love Heart Arrow!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:24.460
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.770
Self!

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:33.440
Girls!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.280
Hey, Mana!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:43.580
See, I'm willing to do so much for you!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.780
Now it's your turn.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:50.450
Quit being friends with these girls for me.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:51.620
Got it?

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:53.890
No.

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:55.590
Say something?

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:57.630
I won't leave them!

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:59.830
I'll never stop being their friend!

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.630
Charles!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:06.970
Precure Love Link!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:09.570
L-O-V-E!

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:10.240
L-O-V-E!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.040
L-O-V-E!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:11.910
L-O-V-E!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:45.840
Brimming with love,

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.080
Cure Heart!

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:53.420
Oh poor refreshment who has lost his love,

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:55.620
I, Cure Heart,

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:58.890
will make your heart race once more!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.860
You drink, too!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.860
Selfish!

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:13.940
Girls!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.540
Mana, that was your fault!

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.240
Those poor girls!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.480
It wasn't Mana's fault...

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:27.620
We're Mana's real friends...

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.650
We're the ones who wanted to be with her! {Not literal with the line, but it's too awkward to match the JP structure.}

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:35.330
We ourselves wished to be by Mana's side!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.860
Hardships like this are nothing we weren't prepared for!

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.360
Diamond!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.570
Rosetta!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.570
So annoying.

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:44.540
Get lost!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.300
Refreshments... drink up!

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.080
Regina, you're wrong!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.750
Wanting to erase the people I hold dear...

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.580
isn't something a friend would ever do!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.650
Why are you opposing me?

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.920
Why won't you do as I say?

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:05.290
We're friends!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.590
It's <i>because</i> we're friends!

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:11.230
I truly want to be your friend, so I'm being honest,

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:13.630
and I'm doing everything I can to right your wrongs!

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.530
I'm not listening!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:16.800
Seeelf!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.040
Listen to her!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:24.640
Friends should always listen to each other!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.140
Sword!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:27.410
Geez!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:30.210
Don't you dare scold me!

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.280
Heart, let's go!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.820
We're ready, too!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:36.790
Indeed!

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:39.290
Diamond, Rosetta!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:49.500
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:11.890
Love love loooooove!

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:19.660
Huh?

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:27.610
Regina, let's be real friends.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:30.140
What's <i>that</i>?

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:31.240
I don't get you!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:38.220
You still want to be friends with Regina?

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.720
Even I have my doubts,

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:45.760
but I just don't think she's rotten to the core.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.230
When I saw her smile...

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.890
I felt that she wasn't.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:56.430
But I know that you have every right to be mad!

00:20:56.900 --> 00:21:00.640
And I'll do anything I can to help Trump Kingdom!

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.570
So... well...

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:08.650
I will never forgive Regina.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:11.080
Even if she's your friend.

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:17.920
But that's just how I feel, okay?

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:23.490
Real friends are honest with each other, right?

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:27.030
So I just tried being honest.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.870
Makopi!

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:33.600
Also, there was way too much omelette rice.

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:35.070
I can't eat that alone!

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:37.610
I made too much on accident...

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.080
Will you help me eat it?

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.720
I can't believe her!

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.490
She tried to scold <i>me</i>?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:51.960
But...

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:54.860
<i>Let's be real friends.</i>

00:21:57.490 --> 00:22:01.030
What <i>is</i> a real friend?

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:29.130
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:31.760
Shock!

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:31.760
Shock!

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.460
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
